  "body": "Replace the remaining try/fail/catch blocks in the SASL client tests\nwith `assertThrows`, following the same cleanup already done for the\nproducer, Streams and Connect tests.\n\n- `SaslAuthenticatorTest#testInvalidMechanism`\n- `OAuthBearerSaslClientTest#testWrapsExtensionsCallbackHandlingErrorInSaslExceptionInFirstClientMessage`\n\nThe assertions on the thrown exception are unchanged.\n\n### Testing\n\n```\n./gradlew :clients:test --tests '*SaslAuthenticatorTest.testInvalidMechanism' --tests '*OAuthBearerSaslClientTest'\n./gradlew :clients:checkstyleTest :clients:spotlessCheck\n```\n",
